my, who one day, while spending some time in the animal shed, finds herself smitten with her upper classman. That upperclassman's name is Katalina, who is renowned for both her wit and beauty. Even as Djeeta shrinks back from Katalina's majesty, the two gradually grow closer. Unbeknownst to them, however, not everyone is excited for their newfound affection.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/An9uRIQqMWH1zOcrEDaPTpHyP5r.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Far away on a remote island, Gran steps into the ring for an exhibition match of ritual proportion. Once a year, top fighters from around the island must gather together for a duel to appease the gods, and anything less than victory could spell grave disaster for the locals. After grinding through some grueling training to master the art of wrestling, Gran enters his match as the mysterious masked fighter, the Masked Cypher. / Djeeta is just an ordinary student at St. Albion Girls' Academy, who one day, while spending some time in the animal shed, finds herself smitten with her upper classman. That upperclassman's name is Katalina, who is renowned for both her wit and beauty. Even as Djeeta shrinks back from Katalina's majesty, the two gradually grow closer. Unbeknownst to them, however, not everyone is excited for their newfound affection.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/An9uRIQqMWH1zOcrEDaPTpHyP5r.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"The Storm Guardian","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11597","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4,5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21361","episodeNumbers":[5,6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31629","episodeNumbers":[4,5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4,5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69820","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"12928","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{}},"synopsis":"Thanks to his skill as a helmsman, Rackam navigates the Grandcypher to the mass of dark clouds, where Tiamat is waiting for them. Gran and his comrades must face this great primal beast to save the Port Breeze Archipelago and its guardian deity.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/319981/6051214.jpg"},{"title":"The Veil Is Lifted","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11597","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5,6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21361","episodeNumbers":[6,7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31629","episodeNumbers":[5,6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5,6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69820","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"12929","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{}},"synopsis":"Gran and company set off for the Valtz Duchy. Siero introduces them to a Valtz Duchy “special operator,” who asks them to search for the missing Archduke Tzaka, the most powerful person in Valtz. They take the job and begin investigating right away, but someone is following them...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/319981/6051215.jpg"},{"title":"The Iron Giant","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11597","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6,7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21361","episodeNumbers":[7,8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31629","episodeNumbers":[6,7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6,7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69820","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"12930","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{}},"synopsis":"Gran and company move on to a secret factory in pursuit of a clue to the missing Archduke Tzaka. Lyria says she hears a voice calling out to her and leads the group to the deepest recesses of the location, where the archduke and an iron giant await.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/319981/6051216.jpg"},{"title":"A Pair Apart","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11597","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7,8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21361","episodeNumbers":[8,9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31629","episodeNumbers":[7,8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7,8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69820","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"12931","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{}},"synopsis":"Gran and company visit another island for supplies, and take on an archaeological exploration job for Siero. The group reaches the ruin’s entrance, but a series of events causes them to split up into two groups. Cut off from each other, they move forward in order to meet up again, and encounter the treasure hunters Mary and Karva along the way.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/319981/6051217.jpg"},{"title":"Horizon in the Clouds","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11597","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8,9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21361","episodeNumbers":[9,10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31629","episodeNumbers":[8,9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8,9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69820","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"12932","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{}},"synopsis":"The group makes their way to the Auguste Isles, an island holding an entire ocean. While examining a mysterious substance, Rackam runs into an old friend who leads them to the capital city of Mizarea. There, the group splits up to tend to smaller tasks, while Gran and Lyria venture off to see the sights.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/319981/6098952.jpg"},{"title":"Separation","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11597","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9,10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21361","episodeNumbers":[10,11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31629","episodeNumbers":[9,10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9,10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69820","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"12933","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{}},"synopsis":"The Auguste Isles are taking fire from the Erste Empire’s attack. Gran pursues the abducted Lyria, rushing towards the airship landing site, where the empire’s warships have appeared. Meanwhile, Pommern makes off with Lyria, but just then, a primal beast, Leviathan, rises from the sea, along with a gigantic column of water.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/319981/6099583.jpg"},{"title":"Lyria`s Wish","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11597","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10,11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21361","episodeNumbers":[11,12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"31629","episodeNumbers":[10,11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"319981","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10,11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"69820","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"12934","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{}},"synopsis":"Gran and company visit the Lumacie Isles in order to wake up the comatose Lyria. Rosetta leads them to a giant tree nestled deep in a forest. She summons Yggdrasil, the primal beast that protects Lumacie, and explains that with her help Gran can enter Lyria’s consciousness.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/319981/6099584.jpg"},{"title":"Showdown on the High Seas","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11597","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11,12]},{"provide